{"id":35065654591,"name":"Run api tests","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAIKhNtPw","head_branch":"perf/default-aoc-dvs-export-43_2.43","head_sha":"63507c88511bb344c7eebc8987311206c1478f35","path":".github/workflows/run-api-tests.yml","run_number":52799,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"perf: skip AOC data-sharing CTE for default-CC data set exports (#25065)","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":5591308,"check_suite_id":94958855189,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAAWG_0kFQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/35065654591","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/35065654591","pull_requests":[{"id":4544798570,"number":25233,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/pulls/25233","head":{"ref":"perf/default-aoc-dvs-export-43_2.43","sha":"63507c88511bb344c7eebc8987311206c1478f35","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}},"base":{"ref":"2.43","sha":"894dd428a136851f9e9ad17a710fc555c6767d9e","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}}}],"created_at":"2026-09-16T06:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T07:06:17Z","run_started_at":"2026-09-16T06:51:28Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/35065654591/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/35065654591/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/94958855189","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/35065654591/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/35065654591/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/35065654591/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"perf: skip AOC data-sharing CTE for default-CC data set exports (#25065)\n\n* perf: skip per-row AOC data-sharing check for default-CC data set exports\n\nData value set exports scoped to data set(s) that all use the default\nattribute category combo can only ever match the default attribute option\ncombo. In that case resolve the default AOC up front and apply it as an\nexplicit filter so the export query skips the per-row AOC data-sharing\ncheck, which otherwise scans the whole categoryoptioncombo table.\n\n- DataExportStore#getDefaultAttributeOptionComboForDataSets resolves the\n  default AOC only when every existing given data set uses the default\n  attribute category combo; returns null otherwise (missing/non-default\n  combo) so the regular per-row check is used.\n- DefaultDataExportService applies it when no explicit attributeOptionCombo\n  / attributeOptions filter is given and the export is data-set-scoped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K1EkU1W5wYfEbRsqX4FcCU\n\n* fix: correct DataExportServiceExportTest fixture and formatting\n\nDataExportServiceExportTest stored data values with attribute option\ncombos cocA/cocB (which belong to category combo ccA) against dsA/dsB,\nwhose attribute category combo defaulted to the default one. That state\nis rejected on import (E8023: AOC must belong to the data set's attribute\ncategory combo) and was only reachable here via the raw dataDumpService\nupsert path. Give dsA/dsB the ccA attribute category combo so the fixture\nis valid; this also stops the new default-AOC fast path from applying to\nthem (non-default CC =\u003e no filter), restoring the expected export counts.\n\nAlso apply spotless formatting (javadoc wrap, query builder chain).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K1EkU1W5wYfEbRsqX4FcCU\n\n* fix: restrict default-AOC export fast path to dataset-only requests [DHIS2-22077]\n\nThe default-AOC fast path in DefaultDataExportService.resolveAttributeOptionCombos\nonly checked that dataSets was non-empty, but the export query unions dataSet\nmembers with independently requested dataElement/dataElementGroup selectors and\nthen applied the inferred default AOC globally. A mixed request (dataset using the\ndefault attribute category combo plus an explicit dataElement/dataElementGroup\nbelonging to a dataset with a non-default combo) silently dropped the\nnon-default-AOC values.\n\nThe fast path now also requires that no dataElement or dataElementGroup selectors\nare present. Adds regression tests: unit tests asserting the fast path is skipped\nfor mixed selectors, and real-pipeline (Postgres, no mocks) tests in\nDataExportServiceExportTest covering both the dataset-only and mixed-selector\ncases end-to-end.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"63507c88511bb344c7eebc8987311206c1478f35","tree_id":"ea30fe8f4b46c5a1ef5e685297a660d12fffbcd0","timestamp":"2026-09-16T06:50:29Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_eve